  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\nNotable changes to the GuiKit packages (`Adliance.AspNetCore.Buddy.GuiKit`, `.Madx` and `.Infrastructure`, which are\nalways published together with the same version). Newest first.\n\n## 2026-10-05\n- Added `<agk-pagination>`.\n- Added `<agk-sidebar>` for a navigation on the left.\n- Buttons and pagination links show a spinner while loading.\n- Added a `confirm` attribute to delete buttons for an \"are you sure\" dialog.\n\n## 2026-10-01\n- Added `<agk-password>`, an input with a toggle to show the password.\n- Buttons support different colors.\n- The MADx login layout is responsive.\n- **Breaking:** AppInsights and KeyVault extensions moved to the new package `Adliance.AspNetCore.Buddy.GuiKit.Infrastructure`\n  (referenced by GuiKit, so no new package reference is needed; change `using` directives to `Adliance.AspNetCore.Buddy.GuiKit.Infrastructure[.Extensions]`).\n\n## 2026-09-30\n- Restructured the CSS with consistent `--agk-*` variable names and cascade layers.\n- Added a common base layout `_AgkLayout`; the MADx layouts are based on it.\n- Added `<agk-button>`, `<agk-modal>`, `<agk-chart>`, `<agk-upload>`, `<agk-checkbox>` and `<agk-chat>`.\n- Selects support sizes; ratings support `readonly`; chat bubbles have a loading animation.\n- Page transitions.\n- Support for a strict CSP by default.\n- `app.UseGuiKitStaticFiles()` for proper caching of static assets.\n- Accessibility improvements and improved form and button styling.\n- The MADx package depends on the GuiKit package of the same version (published together).\n\n## 2026-09-23\n- Configuration order with Key Vault: appsettings.json, Key Vault, environment variables,\n  appsettings.{Environment}.json - so environment variables can override Key Vault secrets.\n\n## 2026-09-09\n- Added `<agk-rating>`.\n- Added `<agk-textarea>`, like `<agk-input>`.\n\n## 2026-08-20\n- `<agk-loading>` supports a `text` attribute and arbitrary HTML attributes.\n- Table header and footer have correct border radii.\n\n## 2026-08-19\n- Inputs support sizes.\n\n## 2026-08-18\n- Added `AddKeyVaultIfConfigured()`, which adds Azure Key Vault as a configuration source if a `KeyVault` connection\n  string is configured.\n- MADx: fixed text decoration of header links; adjusted margins of the login page.\n\n## 2026-08-10\n- MADx: restructured the login layout; it sets `ViewData[\"Version\"]` to the assembly version.\n- MADx: styling of ASP.NET validation errors (`.field-validation-error`).\n- The text decoration of links is configurable via a CSS variable.\n\n## 2026-08-06\n- MADx: moved the logo a little more to the top.\n\n## 2026-08-05\n- Added `<agk-select>`.\n- Form elements inside a `<fieldset>` are laid out side by side.\n- Form controls use `color-scheme: dark` for better native browser controls.\n- Fixed missing static web assets in the MADx package.\n\n## 2026-08-04\n- Added the analyzer that flags tag helper attributes set to their default value.\n- Upgraded FontAwesome to 7.3.1; its CSS is no longer bundled into `min.css` (fixes relative font paths).\n- `<agk-panel>` loads its htmx content on `load, submit` by default.\n- Fixed builds on Windows.\n\n## 2026-07-23\n- Fixed `hx-post` inside panels; it now sends a CSRF token.\n- `<agk-loading>` no longer has a text (added again on 2026-08-20).\n\n## 2026-07-22\n- More htmx settings for panels.\n\n## 2026-07-20\n- `<agk-loading>` supports a status text.\n- Improved margins of elements inside panels.\n- Added a placeholder login layout.\n\n## 2026-07-18\n- Initial version, a copy of the previous public version of GuiKit.\n- Added the MADx theme package.\n- Added `<agk-input>` and `<agk-form-element>` for reusable form elements.\n- Improved button styles.",
